            "kaz": "Тармақша",
            "rus": "Подпункт"
          }
        }
      ],
      "hcontainers": [],
      "note": "Presidential decrees with force of law (normative Ukazы) were widely used in 1993-1995 to fill legislative gaps before the Parliament was constituted. Ongoing normative decrees exist but are subordinate to laws. Structured as flat numbered punkty; map to article."
    },
