    },
    "date_calendar": "gregorian",
    "notes": "The number segment uses the official registration number. Laws cite as: Zakon RK ot {date} № {number}. Roman numeral suffix (e.g. -V, -VI) indicates the convocation of Parliament in which the law was adopted — include in the number segment for disambiguation: e.g. № 480-V → number = '480-v'. No sub-national URI variants needed (Kazakhstan is a unitary state)."
  },
